 \">Connecting with Coaches</span>\n          </span> Easier with Jetson AI\n        </h1>\n        <p className=\"mx-auto mb-8 max-w-2xl text-lg\">\n          Professional photography services for weddings, events, portraits, and commercial shoots. Let us tell your story through our lens.\n        </p>\n    \n        \n        <div className=\"flex justify-center items-center mt-8\" data-aos=\"fade-up\" data-aos-delay=\"400\">\n          <a href=\"#pricing\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\n            className=\"relative flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 bg-green-600 hover700 text-white text-lg font-semibold rounded-full shadow-lg transform hover105 transition-transform duration-200\">\n            <span className=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-green-600 opacity-50 animate-pulse\"></span>\n            <span className=\"relative z-10 pr-2\">Book Now</span>\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    \n      \n      <div className=\"absolute sm14 bottom-10 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 animate-bounce\">\n        <a href=\"#about\" className=\"cursor-pointer\">\n          <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" className=\"h-12 w-12 text-white\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" strokeWidth=\"2\">\n            <path strokeLinecap=\"round\" strokeLinejoin=\"round\" d=\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\" />\n          </svg>\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n",
